{"note": "train.start is a job command: the job id at once, with a note to poll job.get (the run and plan are job.get's); its _meta key is the retry key (contracts 4.7)", "client": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "train__start", "arguments": {"recipe": "classification", "design_path": "<repo>/templates/designs/textcnn.rrsmodel", "dataset_path": "<repo>/fixtures/datasets/textcnn_tiny.jsonl"}, "_meta": {"idempotencyKey": "three-surfaces-train-start"}}}, "server": {"id": 3, "jsonrpc": "2.0", "result": {"content": [{"text": "{\"job_id\":\"<job_id>\"}", "type": "text"}, {"text": "The job runs in the background. Call job__get with this job_id for its state and result.", "type": "text"}], "isError": false, "structuredContent": {"job_id": "<job_id>"}}}}
{"note": "the same train.start with the same key answers the job the first call started, and no second run starts (the key is kept per token)", "client": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "train__start", "arguments": {"recipe": "classification", "design_path": "<repo>/templates/designs/textcnn.rrsmodel", "dataset_path": "<repo>/fixtures/datasets/textcnn_tiny.jsonl"}, "_meta": {"idempotencyKey": "three-surfaces-train-start"}}}, "server": {"id": 4, "jsonrpc": "2.0", "result": {"content": [{"text": "{\"job_id\":\"<job_id>\"}", "type": "text"}, {"text": "The job runs in the background. Call job__get with this job_id for its state and result.", "type": "text"}], "isError": false, "structuredContent": {"job_id": "<job_id>"}}}}
{"note": "the same key with other arguments is refused with RRS-C0004, as over HTTP and the CLI", "client": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "train__start", "arguments": {"recipe": "classification", "design_path": "<repo>/templates/designs/textcnn.rrsmodel", "dataset_path": "<repo>/fixtures/datasets/no_such_dataset.jsonl"}, "_meta": {"idempotencyKey": "three-surfaces-train-start"}}}, "server": {"id": 5, "jsonrpc": "2.0", "result": {"content": [{"text": "RRS-C0004: The idempotency key three-surfaces-train-start was already used with different arguments.\nThis request reuses the id of a different request.\nFix: Send a new idempotency key with a different request.", "type": "text"}], "isError": true}}}
{"note": "job.get of a job no daemon made: RRS-J0005 with the same message and fix as over HTTP and the CLI", "client": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 6, "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "job__get", "arguments": {"job_id": "<job_id>"}}}, "server": {"id": 6, "jsonrpc": "2.0", "result": {"content": [{"text": "RRS-J0005: No job <job_id> is known to this daemon.\nRastai doesn't know this task.\nFix: Refresh the job list and pick a job from it.", "type": "text"}], "isError": true}}}
